            "heading": "The Cedar Bucket Story",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "sb_custom_font": "Neutra Text Book"
          }
        },
        "text_qkYJ3a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cedar Bucket is a local, family-run business founded by Ole Miss alumni who saw a real need in our community—and made it happen. With high demand for affordable furniture and better storage solutions, we created an all-in-one platform to buy, sell, store, and move home furnishings hassle-free. </p><p>Our property boasts over 20,000 square feet of warehouse and storefront space. Once home to the renowned Cedar Bucket Furniture Co.—a beloved name across the Southeast for its quality cedar furniture—it carries a rich legacy. We’ve revitalized the space, enhancing its functionality while preserving its history.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "sb_custom_font": "Neutra Text Book",
            "font_size": 18,
            "sb_font_weight": 400
          }
        }
      },
