            "text": "<p>Standing proudly on our property, the world’s largest cedar bucket serves as a local landmark and a gateway to Oxford. It stands 7 feet tall and 6 feet wide while holding over 1500 gallons of water!</p><p>We invite you to visit, experience the bucket’s grandeur firsthand, and see how we’re carrying forward the Cedar Bucket legacy.</p>",
